    <a class="press-item" href="https://washtheocon.org/for-the-public/figel-address/"><span class="text">Washington Theological Consortium</span><div><h3>The Figel Address on Ecumenical Dialogue</h3><p class="meta">Washington Theological Consortium · Annual</p><p>The Consortium's annual lecture on contemporary issues in ecumenism, named for and sponsored by Jack Figel. It is paired each year with the Consortium Ecumenism Award and a prayer service for Christian unity. Past speakers include Dr. Margaret O'Gara, Fr. John Crossin, OSFS, Rev. Dr. Angelique Walker-Smith, and Archdeacon John Chryssavgis.</p></div></a>
