    <a class="press-item" id="patriarch" href="/conferences/"><img src="/images/seal-patriarchate.png" alt="" style="max-height:72px"><div><h3>Letter from His All-Holiness Ecumenical Patriarch Bartholomew</h3><p class="meta">The Phanar, Constantinople · 2006</p><p class="quote-full">"It is with great pleasure and paternal joy that we humbly greet the blessed Orientale Lumen Conferences. Your pioneering ecumenical gatherings have indeed provided an exceptional forum, and your sacred intent is blessed from within and from above by the very nature of your initiative. For, while your effort may be, as you describe it, 'grass roots,' we are convinced that it is at the same time rooted in heaven."</p><p>The Patriarch has received the Foundation's pilgrims in private audience, hosted three conferences in Constantinople, and has met Jack Figel more than twenty times.</p></div></a>
